# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── secrets
# The API keys. Never commit these, not even to a private repository:
# a private repo can be shared, forked or made public later, and a key in
# history survives all three. configs/ references these by NAME only.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.key
*.pem

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────── build output
# The dashboard's bundle and its synced data copies. Both are regenerated by
# `bun run build`; the originals live in recovery-bench/data/.
dist/
**/dist/
recovery-bench/packages/dashboard/public/

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── deps
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────── scratch and OS
.scratch/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.tmp

# ──────────────────────────────────────────── Word / LaTeX leftovers
~$*.docx
~$*.doc
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
